#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0719 expect=skipped domain=ADLBC
# Rule:Description: Raise an error when a BDS dataset contains none of the subject-level or record-level treatment variables defined in the IG.
#note "Only TRTAG3N is present — a non-first member (y=3). It is a member of the TRTAGyN family defined in the IG (ADaMIG 1.1/1.2/1.3 Table 3.3.2.1 (record-level treatment variables for BDS)), so the CR719 requirement is met and the Requirements.Variables.None entry TRTAGyN skips the rule."
dataset ADLBC
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col AVAL type=Num
col TRTAG3N type=Num
